{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the world of <strong>/S/ Veckor!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015740/extras/0d507a4a29f49bd4aec1aa5309714b75.poster.avif?t=1770483197\" width=608 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015740/extras/0d507a4a29f49bd4aec1aa5309714b75.webm?t=1770483197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015740/extras/0d507a4a29f49bd4aec1aa5309714b75.mp4?t=1770483197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience\u00a0exhilarating and addictive arcade action with the timeless look of vector graphics. <strong>Guide your spaceship</strong> around <strong>hungry aliens</strong> that are out to <strong>ruin your intergalactic high score</strong>, that's if you <strong>let them nibble just too many times</strong> on your fragile little craft. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015740/extras/b4920e881a8e2e0ece5a2dd921a0c3b1.poster.avif?t=1770483197\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015740/extras/b4920e881a8e2e0ece5a2dd921a0c3b1.webm?t=1770483197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015740/extras/b4920e881a8e2e0ece5a2dd921a0c3b1.mp4?t=1770483197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However with your <strong>skill</strong> and a little bit of help from <st